{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 2469697193387595814,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "2026 Term Steering Council election",
      "source_hash": 4140352529337008592,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "2026년 임기 스티어링 카운슬 선거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597166Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 5642444137200010231,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This document describes the schedule and other details of the 2025 election for the Python steering council, as specified in :pep:`13`.",
      "source_hash": 3571135502004613193,
      "context_hash": 8965981301954338001,
      "translation": "이 문서는 :pep:`13`\\ 에 명시된 Python 스티어링 카운슬의 2025년 선거 일정과 기타 세부 사항을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is the steering council election for the 2026 term (i.e. Python 3.15).",
      "source_hash": 28740198541200296,
      "context_hash": 5515396765769932745,
      "translation": "이는 2026년 임기(즉, Python 3.15)를 위한 스티어링 카운슬 선거입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597174Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Election Administration",
      "source_hash": 16550040090148164253,
      "context_hash": 8396061208366450708,
      "translation": "선거 관리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597174Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The steering council appointed the `Python Software Foundation <https://www.python.org/psf-landing/>`__ Director of Infrastructure, Ee Durbin, to administer the election.",
      "source_hash": 4963720401124199556,
      "context_hash": 16543172086966169680,
      "translation": "스티어링 카운슬은 선거를 관리하도록 `Python Software Foundation <https://www.python.org/psf-landing/>`__\\ 의 인프라스트럭처 디렉터인 Ee Durbin을 임명했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597175Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Schedule",
      "source_hash": 17730507104810335965,
      "context_hash": 15425919283844796520,
      "translation": "일정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597175Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There was be a two-week nomination period, followed by a two-week vote.",
      "source_hash": 11651228973821348493,
      "context_hash": 10183572741482904695,
      "translation": "2주간의 후보 추천 기간에 이어 2주간의 투표 기간이 진행되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The nomination period was: November 10, 2025 through `November 24, 2025 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+nominations+close&iso=20251125T00&p1=3399>`_ [#note-aoe]_.",
      "source_hash": 10239695907923028357,
      "context_hash": 10697039732593626329,
      "translation": "후보 추천 기간은 2025년 11월 10일부터 `2025년 11월 24일 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+nominations+close&iso=20251125T00&p1=3399>`_ [#note-aoe]_\\ 까지였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597176Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The voting period was: November 28, 2025 through `December 12, 2025 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+voting+closes&iso=20251213T00&p1=3399>`_ [#note-aoe]_.",
      "source_hash": 7104470703624902198,
      "context_hash": 9517073003127795111,
      "translation": "투표 기간은 2025년 11월 28일부터 `2025년 12월 12일 AoE <https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/fixedtime.html?msg=Python+Steering+Council+voting+closes&iso=20251213T00&p1=3399>`_ [#note-aoe]_\\ 까지였습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates",
      "source_hash": 1549024387910241940,
      "context_hash": 16424204713616824293,
      "translation": "후보자",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Candidates must be nominated by a core team member.",
      "source_hash": 15625689760213116169,
      "context_hash": 520011488141833222,
      "translation": "후보자는 핵심 팀 구성원이 추천해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597177Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If the candidate is a core team member, they may nominate themselves.",
      "source_hash": 334448297257708624,
      "context_hash": 6017710446542411990,
      "translation": "후보자가 핵심 팀 구성원인 경우에는 스스로를 추천할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Nominees (in alphabetical order by first name):",
      "source_hash": 13368882531600933152,
      "context_hash": 8833053563643912757,
      "translation": "후보자(이름 기준 알파벳순):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597178Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`Barry Warsaw <https://discuss.python.org/t/steering-council-nomination-barry-warsaw-2026-term/104937>`_",
      "source_hash": 13367498327728310286,
      "context_hash": 18236373563164435321,
      "translation": "`Barry Warsaw <https://discuss.python.org/t/steering-council-nomination-barry-warsaw-2026-term/104937>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
