      "source_hash": 17663305505374952757,
      "context_hash": 13585455586995030561,
      "translation": "`Thomas Wouters <https://discuss.python.org/t/steering-council-nomination-thomas-wouters-2026-term/104954>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597180Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Withdrawn nominations:",
      "source_hash": 788993590756453881,
      "context_hash": 4468033979777877793,
      "translation": "철회된 후보 추천:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "None",
      "source_hash": 4387124778405518223,
      "context_hash": 17574083411957277762,
      "translation": "없음",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Voter Roll",
      "source_hash": 9433122607206423300,
      "context_hash": 15689242719555303773,
      "translation": "유권자 명부",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597181Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "All active Python core team members are eligible to vote.",
      "source_hash": 16621469274156202773,
      "context_hash": 4650596352921137859,
      "translation": "모든 활성 Python 핵심 팀 구성원은 투표할 자격이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597182Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Active status is determined as :pep:`described in PEP 13 <13#membership>` and implemented via the software at `python/voters <https://github.com/python/voters>`_ [#note-voters]_.",
      "source_hash": 14284167419219041845,
      "context_hash": 8778937636402509534,
      "translation": "활성 상태는 :pep:`described in PEP 13 <13#membership>`\\ 에 설명된 대로 결정되며 `python/voters <https://github.com/python/voters>`_ [#note-voters]_\\ 의 소프트웨어를 통해 구현됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597182Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Ballots will be distributed based on the `Python Voter Roll <https://github.com/python/voters/blob/master/voter-files/>`_ [#note-voters]_ for this election.",
      "source_hash": 3949210656398045924,
      "context_hash": 1684888647559389403,
      "translation": "이 선거의 투표용지는 `Python Voter Roll <https://github.com/python/voters/blob/master/voter-files/>`_ [#note-voters]_\\ 을 기준으로 배포됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597182Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "While this file is not public as it contains private email addresses, the `Complete Voter Roll`_ by name will be made available when the roll is created.",
      "source_hash": 8895222127747436580,
      "context_hash": 726268541533148482,
      "translation": "이 파일에는 비공개 이메일 주소가 포함되어 있어 공개되지 않지만, 명부가 작성되면 이름별 `Complete Voter Roll`_\\ 은 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597183Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Election Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14636875904910317783,
      "context_hash": 16199312510171761990,
      "translation": "선거 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597183Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The election will be conducted using the `BetterVoting <https://bettervoting.com>`__ service.",
      "source_hash": 4389848458805840988,
      "context_hash": 17837783710258165749,
      "translation": "선거는 `BetterVoting <https://bettervoting.com>`__ 서비스를 사용하여 실시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597183Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This election will be the first to use `Multi-winner Bloc STAR <https://www.starvoting.org/multi_winner>`__ voting as `approved by the core team <https://discuss.python.org/t/64971>`__ and `codified <https://github.com/python/peps/pull/3958/files>`__ into :pep:`13`.",
      "source_hash": 13603855415018072692,
      "context_hash": 5608742634979266688,
      "translation": "이번 선거는 핵심 팀이 `승인한 <https://discuss.python.org/t/64971>`__\\ 하고 `:pep:`\\ 13\\ `에 성문화한 <https://github.com/python/peps/pull/3958/files>`__ `Multi-winner Bloc STAR <https://www.starvoting.org/multi_winner>`__ 투표를 사용하는 첫 선거입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597184Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 5660238544799144806,
      "translation": "구성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:27.597184Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Create a `new election <https://bettervoting.com/new_election>`__.",
      "source_hash": 14602254167746316406,
      "context_hash": 12348295506166688085,
      "translation": "`new election <https://bettervoting.com/new_election>`__\\ 을 생성하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075063Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Poll or Election?: ``Election``",
      "source_hash": 10090983137288569883,
      "context_hash": 16455536368104707898,
      "translation": "설문 또는 선거?: ``Election``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075067Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Title?: ``2026 Python Steering Council Election``",
      "source_hash": 12579315496309650012,
      "context_hash": 2524620868754855066,
      "translation": "제목?: ``2026 Python Steering Council Election``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075067Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Restricted?: ``Yes``",
      "source_hash": 4052617229018636342,
      "context_hash": 7950572681601504540,
      "translation": "제한됨?: ``Yes``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075068Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Contact Email: ``psf-election@python.org``",
      "source_hash": 12299502306967933215,
      "context_hash": 18368235023185729236,
      "translation": "연락처 이메일: ``psf-election@python.org``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075068Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Choose Voters: ``Email List``",
      "source_hash": 10799038499784614846,
      "context_hash": 2442305816852277288,
      "translation": "유권자 선택: ``Email List``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075068Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "This will initialize the election and you will be forwarded to the election admin page.",
      "source_hash": 4672341017504668021,
      "context_hash": 15150830176693738194,
      "translation": "그러면 선거가 초기화되고 선거 관리자 페이지로 이동합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075068Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Further configuration is required.",
      "source_hash": 12142229943108732783,
      "context_hash": 17165256536563060038,
      "translation": "추가 구성이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Click the pencil icon next to the election name on the admin.",
      "source_hash": 15766836033219933553,
      "context_hash": 17567164548780623209,
      "translation": "관리자 페이지에서 선거 이름 옆의 연필 아이콘을 클릭하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Election Description: ``Election for the Python steering council, as specified in PEP 13.",
      "source_hash": 17571587776722505248,
      "context_hash": 3307529880818496683,
      "translation": "선거 설명: ``Python 운영 위원회를 위한 선거이며, PEP 13에 명시되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "This is the steering council election for the 2026 term.``",
      "source_hash": 17073107137235472405,
      "context_hash": 12388228089237707994,
      "translation": "이는 2026년 임기를 위한 운영 위원회 선거입니다.``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:41:19.075069Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Enable Start/End Times?: ``Check this box``",
      "source_hash": 12165231135330502541,
